# =====================================================================================
#  .gitignore for C:\runGTAP375\Game_theory_2024
#  1. No copy of the licensed GTAP Data Base, in any folder.
#  2. Nothing GEMPACK / RunGTAP regenerates on every solve.
#  3. No archive folder ("0. Old", "Old", BU, SaveSims) and no file above GitHub's 100 MB limit.
#  A pattern without a slash applies to every folder of the repository.
# =====================================================================================

# ---- 1. GTAP Data Base, parameters and their derivatives (licensed - never push) ----------
basedata.har
baserate.har
baseview.har
gtapSAM.har
gsdf*.har
co2.har
metadata.har
default.prm
default*.prm
default*.pel
altertax.*
gdx.zip
gtapv6.zip

# ---- 2. archive folders: old model copies (contain the database, exe's, solutions) --------
9_Archive/
**/0. Old/
**/Old/
**/2_Model_*/
**/3_Output_*/
BU/
SaveSims/

# ---- 3. GEMPACK / RunGTAP work, solution and compile files (regenerated by every run) -----
*.sl4
*.slc
*.sol
*.xac
*.e2k
*.pwk
*.iwk
*.swk
*.dwk
*.ewk
*.cdk
*.uc5
*.aal
*.exs
*.rdt
*.upd
*.shk
*.sli
*.log
*.LOG
*.mnc
*.min
*.inf
*.axs
*.axt
*.gss
*.gst
*.pel
*.exe
*.EXP
*.exp
gpx*.log
DECOMP.har
SUMMARY.har
GTAPVOL.har
aez-ceqexplen.har
*assert-arith-fail*
wmiccap.tmpwmic
3_Output/**/*.har

# ---- 4. files above GitHub's 100 MB limit (the ISO x AEZ split csv, rebuilt by the R script; the _agg csv are kept)
4_DB/Database_GTAPAEZ_all_results_2024*.csv
!4_DB/Database_GTAPAEZ_all_results_2024_agg*.csv

# ---- 5. archives, temporary and system files --------------------------------------------
*.zip
*.7z
*.bak
*.hyper
*.twbr
.RData
.Rhistory
.Rproj.user/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
~$*
